  "licenseScope": "CC BY applies to original artistic contributions only; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.",
  "assistance": "AI-assisted (Claude): the TypeScript generator generators/dlr-peoplemover-track.ts was written from the open evidence in the modelling notes (OSM, public lidar and aerials, licensed photographs, published dimensions), reviewed by a human against reference photos, and exported deterministically. No photographic textures.",
